{"seq":2,"slug":"jepa-joint-embedding-world-models","title":"JEPA 联合嵌入世界模型","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-frontier-research","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# JEPA 联合嵌入世界模型\n\n2025 年 6 月，Meta 发布的 V-JEPA 2 用不到 62 小时的机器人数据，让一个从百万小时视频里学出来的模型零样本驱动了真实机械臂。\n这是「联合嵌入预测架构」（JEPA）从 Yann LeCun 的理论论纲走向可验证系统的标志性一刻。\n本 hub 讲的就是这条路线的全貌：为什么不生成像素、潜空间预测如何工作、它与三大范式争的是什么、证据有多硬，以及你今天能上手做什么。\n先说定位与边界。\n本 hub 属于 ai-frontier-research 类别，与四个兄弟 hub 分工明确而不重叠。\n《1_pretraining-data-engineering》讲预训练数据的工程化处理本身，本 hub 只关心视频数据在 JEPA 配方中的角色。\n《3_rlvr-verifiable-reward-training》讲可验证奖励下的强化学习，本 hub 的规划篇刻意绕开奖励设计，两者恰好构成「学行动」的两极。\n《4_ai-for-science-discovery》关注 AI 对科学发现的应用，本 hub 不涉及。\n《5_frontier-safety-frameworks》讨论安全治理框架，本 hub 只在开放问题处触及能力边界。\n读完本 hub 你应能独立判断一件事：JEPA 路线到底证明了什么、没证明什么。\n再看整体脉络，四条主线严格递进。\n第一章「动机与机制」立地基：LeCun 论纲的信息论论证、联合嵌入的目标函数与防坍缩设计、I-JEPA 到 V-JEPA 2 的家族演进。\n第二章「范式对比」把 JEPA 放回谱系里，逐一对阵对比学习、掩码建模、Genie 类生成式系统与 LLM 路线。\n第三章「实证与应用」拆解 V-JEPA 2 的三层证据链、潜空间规划的算法细节与当前全部开放问题。\n第四章「上手实践」给出开源资产地图、探针评测协议与 2026 年前沿动向。\n然后是推荐学习路径。\n想理解技术全貌的研究者按章顺读即可。\n工程背景、时间有限的读者可走捷径：先读《JEPA 家族》建立地图，再跳《V-JEPA 2 的能力面》看证据，最后用《开源实现与复现指南》动手。\n对范式之争感兴趣的读者可直接进入第二章，但建议先读《为什么不生成像素》补足信息论动机。\n每篇文档都标明了自己的独占内容与指向兄弟篇章的链接，重复已被刻意清除。\n最后是前置知识。\n线性代数与基础概率论是底线，条件熵与互信息的直觉即可。\n了解 ViT 与自监督学习的基本概念会显著降低第一章的阅读成本。\n第四章需要 Python 与 PyTorch 的使用经验，机器人实验部分还需要对机械臂控制有基本认知。\n不满足这些前提也能读，但建议配合对应领域的入门材料并行补课。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"motivation-mechanism","title":"动机与机制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/motivation-mechanism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-not-generative","title":"为什么不生成像素：LeCun 论纲","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/motivation-mechanism/why-not-generative"},{"seq":2,"slug":"jepa-mechanism","title":"JEPA 机制：联合嵌入与潜空间预测","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/motivation-mechanism/jepa-mechanism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"jepa-family-tree","title":"JEPA 家族：I-JEPA、V-JEPA 与 V-JEPA 2","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/motivation-mechanism/jepa-family-tree"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"paradigm-comparison","title":"范式对比","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/paradigm-comparison","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vs-contrastive-masked","title":"对比学习与掩码建模路线","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/paradigm-comparison/vs-contrastive-masked"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vs-generative-world-models","title":"生成式世界模型（Genie 类）","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/paradigm-comparison/vs-generative-world-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vs-llm-world-models","title":"LLM 作为世界模型的争论","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/paradigm-comparison/vs-llm-world-models"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"evidence-applications","title":"实证与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/evidence-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vjepa2-capabilities","title":"V-JEPA 2 的能力面：理解、预测与零样本机器人","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/evidence-applications/vjepa2-capabilities"},{"seq":2,"slug":"planning-with-latent-models","title":"用潜空间模型做规划","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/evidence-applications/planning-with-latent-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"open-problems","title":"开放问题清单","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/evidence-applications/open-problems"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"getting-hands-dirty","title":"上手实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/getting-hands-dirty","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"open-implementations","title":"开源实现与复现指南","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/getting-hands-dirty/open-implementations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"probing-evaluation","title":"探针评测方法","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/getting-hands-dirty/probing-evaluation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"research-frontier-2026","title":"2026 研究前沿观察","url":"/h/ai-frontier-research/jepa-joint-embedding-world-models/getting-hands-dirty/research-frontier-2026"}]}]}